<title>AUSTRIA: VA Stahl buys into Dutch GC de Jong.</title>
<headline>VA Stahl buys into Dutch GC de Jong.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian steelmaker VA Stahl said on Monday it had taken a 30 percent stake in Dutch pipemaker GC de Jong Construction BV through subsidiary Voest Alpine Stahl Linz GmbH.</p>
<p>In a statement, VA Stahl said the purchase was in accordance with its strategy of controlled growth. It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
